      "content": "i'm definitely going to try it. i've even been setting up a specific room for it. but i'm a little nervous about how to actually monitor the progress. i don't want to get confused if i start having hallucinations or something from the isolation. \n\nif my body is truly rerouting its neural processing to this new interface, how do i tell the difference between a real biological \"recalibration\" and just my brain reacting to the lack of stimulus? are there specific physiological markers or \"milestones\" i should be looking for to confirm that this is a successful evolutionary step instead of just me losing touch with reality?",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
